<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Meal Plan Accommodation Verification Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    font-size: 36pt;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .contact-info {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .form-section {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .field-row {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .field-row > div {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .label {
    font-weight: bold;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
  .input-line {
    border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
    min-height: 1em;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    font-weight: normal;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .question-block {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-left: 15px;
    border-left: 2px solid #ccc;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 50px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .signature-area {
    width: 45%;
  }
  .signature-area div {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 9pt;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">Kenyon College</div>
    <div class="contact-info">
      Student Accessibility and Support Services (SASS)<br>
      <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span> &middot; <span data-field="website_url">{{ website_url }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <h2>MEAL PLAN ACCOMMODATION VERIFICATION FORM</h2>
    <p>Kenyon College is committed to supporting students with disabilities with reasonable meal plan accommodations to provide equal access to the College's dining plan and facility. The Meal Plan Accommodation Policy applies to all students and explains the specific steps necessary to request a meal plan accommodation at Kenyon College.</p>
    <p>The American with Disabilities Act (ADA) defines a person with a disability as someone who has a physical or mental impairment that substantially limits one or more major life activities. The three factors influencing a determination of substantial limitation are 1) the nature and severity of the impairment, 2) the duration or expected duration of the impairment, and 3) whether the impairment is characterized as permanent or long-term.</p>
    <p>Students <span data-field="must_complete_status">{{ must_complete_status }}</span> and submit a Meal Plan Request in the Accommodate system. When the disability and/or need for accommodation is not obvious, students may also be asked to have a treating healthcare provider complete and submit a Meal Plan Accommodation Verification Form to the SASS Office. This form provides the SASS office with reliable documentation that the student has a disability. Documentation must also show that the requested accommodation is necessary to provide them with equal access to the College's meal plan and/or facility; in addition, there must be an identifiable relationship, or nexus, between the requested accommodation and their disability. The treating health care provider completing the form must specialize in a field consistent with the diagnosis, as well as be familiar with the student's disability and the necessity for the requested accommodation. To avoid any conflict of interest, documentation must be provided by a non-family healthcare provider.</p>
    <p>Please see the Meal Plan Accommodation Policy, located on the <a href="#" data-field="policy_link">{{ policy_link }}</a> for additional information.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <div class="field-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">STUDENT NAME:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="student_name">{{ student_name }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">Date:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">STUDENT DATE OF BIRTH:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="student_date_of_birth">{{ student_date_of_birth }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">Date of most recent visit:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="date_of_most_recent_visit">{{ date_of_most_recent_visit }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">PRINT NAME OF PROVIDER:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="print_name_of_provider">{{ print_name_of_provider }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">FAX #:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">ADDRESS:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="address">{{ address }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">TELEPHONE #:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="telephone">{{ telephone }}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="field-row">
      <div>
        <span class="label">EMAIL:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="email">{{ email }}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <!-- Empty space for alignment -->
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Page 1 of 3<br>
    Meal Plan Accommodation Verification Form Updated 1/2026
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>PLEASE SUBMIT ANSWERS TO THE FOLLOWING QUESTIONS:</h2>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>1. Based upon the definition above, does this student have a disability?</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>2. If yes, please state the medical diagnosis:</p>
    <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="no">{{ no }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>3. Is this condition permanent?</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>4. Does the student require ongoing treatment?</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>5. Please state the date of diagnosis:</p>
    <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="no_2">{{ no_2 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>6. Was this diagnosis made by you?</p>
    <div class="checkbox-group">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>7. If the diagnosis was not made by you, by whom was it made?</p>
    <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="no_3">{{ no_3 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="question-block">
    <p>8. How long have you known this student and in what capacity?</p>
    <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="no_4">{{ no_4 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>In addition please answer the allergen specific questions below:</p>

    <div class="question-block">
      <p>1) Specify level of sensitivity for all food allergies. Specify each allergen, and mark all that apply. Please explain.</p>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> life threatening/anaphylaxis (Student carries an epi-pen)</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> due to airborne contact</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> due to cross-contamination</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> due to ingesting food, only</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> other (please specify)</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> high sensitivity, no anaphylaxis</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> due to airborne contact</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> due to cross-contamination</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> due to ingesting food, only</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> other (please specify)</label>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
      <p>2) If applicable and not already provided above, please provide a list of foods that must be avoided (categories) and/or foods that are acceptable (categories).</p>
      <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="other">{{ other }}</div>
    </div>

    <div class="question-block">
      <p>3) Describe the requested meal plan accommodation. Please explain how the requested accommodation is necessary to allow equal access to the College's meal plan and facility. In addition, mark all that apply.</p>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        <label><input type="checkbox"> gluten-free menu options</label>
        <label><input type="checkbox"> dairy and lactose-free menu options</label>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section">
    <p>If recommending a meal plan exemption please describe the severity and frequency of symptoms and how the condition impacts the student's ability to participate in the College's meal plan and/or eat in the College's dining facility.</p>
    <p>Thank you for taking the time to complete this form. If we need additional information, we may contact you at a later date. The named student has signed this form (below) indicating written permission to share additional information with us in support of the request.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div class="signature-area">
      <div>
        <span class="label">Professional signature</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="professional_signature">{{ professional_signature }}</div>
        <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Type of License: <span data-field="license_type">{{ license_type }}</span></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">Date:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</div>
        <p style="margin-top: 5px;">License #: <span data-field="license_number">{{ license_number }}</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="signature-area">
      <div>
        <span class="label">STUDENT (please sign this form before providing it to your treating health provider to complete):</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="license">{{ license }}</div>
        <p style="margin-top: 5px;">By signing below, I consent to allowing my health care provider to share any information relevant to my request for an ESA as an accommodation in the residence hall, as shown on this form, with the Director of SASS at Kenyon College for the next 60 days.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="label">Signature:</span>
        <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</div>
        <p style="margin-top: 5px;">Date: <div class="input-line" style="width: 100%;" data-field="signature_2">{{ signature_2 }}</div></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-section" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <p>Please return this completed document to:</p>
    <p>The Office of Student Accessibility and Support Services</p>
    <p>sass@kenyon.edu</p>
    <p>Kenyon College</p>
    <p>Gambier, OH 43022</p>
    <p>Telephone: <span data-field="phone_number_2">{{ phone_number_2 }}</span> Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    Kenyon College does not discriminate in its educational programs and activities on the basis of race, color, national origin, ancestry, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, physical and/or mental disability, age, religion, medical condition, veteran status, marital status, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by institutional policy or state, local, or federal law. The requirement of non-discrimination programs and activities extends to employment and admission.
    <br><br>
    Page 3 of 3<br>
    Meal Plan Accommodation Verification Form Updated 1/2026
  </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>